OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity considers plans to
OL,4,Aclose campus by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of Brighton says it is
OL,7,Fconsidering closing one of its three
OL,8,Fcampuses from 2030 in favour of
OL,9,Fcondensing its operation into two
OL,10,Fsites.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for the university says
OL,13,Fit hopes to move its operation from its
OL,14,FFalmer campus to its City and
OL,15,FMoulsecoomb sites, which it says will
OL,16,Fmake it stronger and more sustainable.
OL,18,FNo decision has yet been made to close
OL,19,Fthe Falmer campus and it plans to
OL,20,Fconsult on the changes, the university
OL,21,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
