OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity considers plans to
OL,4,Aclose campus by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FCiting pressures on universities across
OL,7,Fthe UK, it said: "We're choosing to
OL,8,Fshape our own future, building a
OL,9,Funiversity that is stronger, more
OL,10,Fsustainable and better connected to the
OL,11,Fneeds of future students, employers,
OL,12,Fcommunities and partners."
